## Diff of the last committed version
Fix online-softmax O rescaling: interleave PV mma inside the per-tile loop so o_frag *= exp(m_prev-m_new) multiplies already-accumulated O (was multiplying zeros since PV ran after all 4 tiles). Add OOB key masking for seq_len % 64 != 0. FA2-style sm_86 wmma m16n16k16 kernel, cp.async double-buffered K/V, padded smem, GQA support. 31.8 TFLOPS vs 2.37 seed.

